{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.JonesHopfSkein","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JonesHopfSkein","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCategoricalPrecisionLadder"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jonesHopfClassicalLimit_eq_jonesHopfValue_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jonesHopfClassicalLimit_eq_jonesHopfValue_one","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/JonesHopfSkein.lean#L67-L73","doc":"**The ladder's `c₃` constant is the skein-derived Hopf value at `q = 1`.**\n`jonesHopfClassicalLimit = jonesHopfValue 1 = −2`: the constant wired into\nthe Q_β ladder's N=3 rung is exactly the classical-point value of the\nskein-derived Hopf Jones polynomial, no longer a bare assertion. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jonesHopfValue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jonesHopfValue","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/JonesHopfSkein.lean#L63-L65","doc":"The derived reduced Jones polynomial of the positive Hopf link,\n`V(Hopf)(s) = −(s + s⁵)` in `s = √t`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jonesHopf_at_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jonesHopf_at_one","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/JonesHopfSkein.lean#L50-L61","doc":"**`J_Hopf(1) = −2`, derived.** At the classical point `s = 1` (`q = 1`) the\nskein derivation gives the Hopf value `−2` — the ladder's\n`jonesHopfClassicalLimit`, now a theorem conditional only on the Jones skein\naxioms rather than an asserted constant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jonesHopf_of_skein","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jonesHopf_of_skein","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/JonesHopfSkein.lean#L35-L48","doc":"**The Hopf-link Jones value from the skein relation.** Over any `CommRing`,\ngiven the cleared Jones data — `V(unknot) = 1`, `s·V(2-unlink) = −(s²+1)`\n(i.e. `V(2-unlink) = −(s+s⁻¹)`), and the cleared skein\n`V₊ − s⁴·V₋ = (s³−s)·V₀` at the Hopf crossing — the positive Hopf link has\n\n  `V(Hopf) = −(s + s⁵)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}